flowchart TD
  Current[Inspect current package] --> Upstream[Inspect upstream and provenance]
  Upstream --> Boundary[Mark Codex-native boundary]
  Boundary --> Contract[Add manifest and composition contracts]
  Contract --> Workflow[Define workflow, gates, stops]
  Workflow --> Checks[Deterministic checks and known-bad evals]
  Checks --> Benchmark[Benchmark against baseline]
  Benchmark --> Decision{Promotion criteria met?}
  Decision -- yes --> Promote[Promote with evidence]
  Decision -- no --> Reject[Keep candidate / reject / revise]
  Promote --> Monitor[Monitor drift and regressions]
  Reject --> Current
